<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Masazumi_Ozawa> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Masazumi Ozawa** (小澤 正澄, *Ozawa Masazumi*) is a Japanese composer, arranger and guitarist from agency [Being Inc.](:Being_Inc%2E)In 1991, he debuted as a composer for Japanese rock band Wands debut single's b-side track *Stray Cat*.In years 1995-2001, he was member of power-pop unit [Pamelah](:Pamelah_%28music_group%29) as a composer, arranger, keyboardist, music sequencer and guitarist. During time he constantly provided music for artist as Kaori Nanao, Kondo Fusanosuke, [Zard](:Zard) or [Field of View](:Field_of_View). As leader of Pamelah, he produced over 14 singles and 5 studio albums.Since disband he continued providing music for various artist including [U-ka Saegusa in dB](:U-ka_Saegusa_in_dB), [Azumi Uehara](:Azumi_Uehara), [Aiko Kitahara](:Aiko_Kitahara) or [Rina Aiuchi](:Rina_Aiuchi).He's active as of 2020."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
