<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Daryl_Simmons> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Daryl L. Simmons** is an American [R&B](:R%26B) [musician](:Musician), [songwriter](:Songwriter) and [record producer](:Record_producer), who worked with the production duo of [L.A. Reid](:L%2EA%2E_Reid) and [Kenneth \"Babyface\" Edmonds](:Kenneth_%22Babyface%22_Edmonds). In 1977–1980 Daryl, with [Manchild (band)](:Manchild_%28band%29) recorded 2 [soul](:Soul_music) & [funk](:Funk) albums & the minor hit \"Especially for You\" on the Label [Chi Sound Records](:Chi_Sound_Records), Manchild included: Kenneth [Babyface](:Babyface_%28musician%29) Edmonds, Reggie Griffin, Charles \"Chuckie\" Bush & others.He has written and composed songs such as \"[End Of The Road](:End_of_the_Road_%28Boyz_II_Men_song%29)\" ([Boyz II Men](:Boyz_II_Men%29), \"[Super Woman](:Superwoman_%28Karyn_White_song%29)\" ([Karyn White](:Karyn_White%29), \"[Breathe Again](:Breathe_Again)\" ([Toni Braxton](:Toni_Braxton%29), \"[I'm Ready](:I%27m_Ready_%28Tevin_Campbell_song%29)\" ([Tevin Campbell](:Tevin_Campbell%29), \"[Baby Baby Baby](:Baby-Baby-Baby)\" ([TLC](:TLC_%28group%29)), \"[My My My](:My%2C_My%2C_My_%28Johnny_Gill_song%29)\" ([Johnny Gill](:Johnny_Gill%29), \"[We're Not Making Love No More](:We%27re_Not_Making_Love_No_More)\" ([Dru Hill](:Dru_Hill%29) and \"[Queen of the Night](:Queen_of_the_Night_%28song%29)\" ([Whitney Houston](:Whitney_Houston%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
