<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Maino_(rapper)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Jermaine John Coleman (born August 30, 1978), better known by his stage name Maino, is an American rapper from Brooklyn, New York City. His debut single \"Hi Hater\" peaked at #16 on Billboard's Hot Rap Songs. His follow-up, \"All the Above,\" features American singer T-Pain and was certified platinum by the Recording Industry Association of America (RIAA). To date Maino has sold just under 4 million digital singles globally."@en .
