<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ravinder_Grewal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Ravinder Grewal** (born 28 March 1963) is an Indian singer and actor. He has produced a [Punjabi-language film](:Punjabi_cinema), *[Raula Pai Gaya](:Raula_Pai_Gaya)*, through his own [production house](:Production_house). In 2015, he featured in the legal comedy *[Judge Singh LLB](:Judge_Singh_LLB)*. His most popular songs include \"Lovely V/s PU\" and \"Jatt Karjai\", lyrics of both are penned by [Preet Sanghreri](:Preet_Sanghreri)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
