<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kylie_Minogue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Kylie Ann Minogue AO OBE (/mɪˈnoʊɡ/ min-OHG; born 28 May 1968), also known mononymously as Kylie, is an Australian singer, songwriter and actress. She is the highest-selling female Australian artist of all time, having sold over 80 million records worldwide. She has been recognised for reinventing herself in music and fashion, for which she is referred to by the European press as the \"Princess of Pop\" and a style icon. Her accolades include a Grammy Award, three Brit Awards and 17 ARIA Music Awards."@en .
