<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Serena_Ryder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Serena Lauren Ryder (born December 8, 1982) is a Canadian singer-songwriter. Born in Toronto, she grew up in Millbrook, Ontario. Ryder first gained national recognition with her ballad \"Weak in the Knees\" in 2007 and has released eight studio albums."@en .
