<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hays,_Kansas> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Hays** is a city in and the [county seat](:County_seat) of [Ellis County](:Ellis_County%2C_Kansas), [Kansas](:Kansas), United States. The largest city in northwestern Kansas, it is the economic and cultural center of the region. As of the [2020 census](:2020_United_States_census), the population of the city was 21,116. It is also a [college town](:College_town), home to [Fort Hays State University](:Fort_Hays_State_University)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
