<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Isadora_Records> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Isadora Records is an independent record label started and operated by Hawksley Workman. The first album released was Workman's own debut, For Him and the Girls, in 1999. The label has been releasing albums online since 2004. Isadora's earlier releases were manufactured and distributed by Universal Music, but more recently they have been distributed by Warner Music in Canada, Sheer Music in the US, and Alternative Distribution Alliance in other markets. Isadora's recording artists have included Hawksley Workman and Serena Ryder."@en .
