<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ørjan_Nilsen> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Ørjan Nilsen** (Template:IPA-no; born 14 June 1982) is a Norwegian [producer](:Record_producer) and [DJ](:Disc_jockey) ranked inside the Top 250 DJs in his genre by the annual DJ Mag Top 100 poll. His debut studio album In My Opinion was released in 2011, followed by No Saint Out of Me in 2013 and Prism in 2018.His discography features collaborations with [Armin van Buuren](:Armin_van_Buuren), [Cosmic Gate](:Cosmic_Gate), Fingerling among others."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
