<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kaya_(Mauritian_musician)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Joseph Réginald Topize (10 August 1960 – 21 February 1999) professionally known by his stage name Kaya was a Mauritian musician and the creator of \"seggae\", a fusion of Mauritian sega and reggae; two popular music genres in Mauritius. Kaya died while in police custody (purportedly beaten to death by the police); he was arrested for smoking Marijuana during one of his concerts."@en .
