<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Grants_Pass,_Oregon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Grants Pass** is the [county seat](:County_seat) of [Josephine County, Oregon](:Josephine_County%2C_Oregon), United States. The city is located on [Interstate 5](:Interstate_5_in_Oregon), northwest of [Medford](:Medford%2C_Oregon), along the [Rogue River](:Rogue_River_%28Oregon%29). The population was 39,189 at the [2020 census](:2020_United_States_Census)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
