<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Edinburgh> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Edinburgh (/ˈɛdɪnbərə/; Scots: ᅠ[ˈɛdɪnbʌrə]; Scottish Gaelic: Dùn Èideann [ˌt̪un ˈeːtʲən̪ˠ]) is the capital city of Scotland and one of its 32 council areas. Historically part of the county of Midlothian (interchangeably Edinburghshire before 1921), it is located in Lothian on the southern shore of the Firth of Forth. Edinburgh is Scotland's second-most populous city, after Glasgow, and the seventh-most populous city in the United Kingdom."@en .
