<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Country_Road_(band)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Country Road was a countryband in Örebro, Sweden, active between 1973–1984. The band played at the Grand Ole Opry in Nashville. The band also managed to chart at the Swedish album charts."@en .
