<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Edward_Bruce_(music_executive)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Edward Bruce is a British executive music producer, record executive, and businessman. In 2017, he received a Gold certification award in France and Belgium for his contribution to Loïc Nottet’s Selfocracy album which was a Sony/Jive Epic release. He also won the Platinum certification award in Belgium for his contribution."@en .
