<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Saharanpur> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Saharanpur** is a city and a [municipal corporation](:Municipal_corporation) in [Uttar Pradesh](:Uttar_Pradesh), [India](:India). It is also the [administrative](:Public_administration) headquarters of [Saharanpur district](:Saharanpur_district).Saharanpur city's name was given after the Saint Shah Haroon Chishti.Saharanpur is declared as one amongst the 100 Smart Cities by [MOUD](:Ministry_of_Housing_and_Urban_Affairs) as a part of [Smart Cities Mission](:Smart_Cities_Mission) of the [Government of India](:Government_of_India)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
