<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kiing_Shooter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**William Antonio Daniels** ((1992-07-25)July 25, 1992 – (2020-05-05)May 5, 2020), better known by his stage name **Kiing Shooter**, was an American rapper from [Queensbridge, New York](:Queensbridge%2C_New_York). Kiing Shooter first came into the public eye alongside NYC rapper and longtime friend [Dave East](:Dave_East), after releasing numerous freestyles with the rapper in 2017. Kiing Shooter gained recognition with his single \"They Say\" which was released on June 29, 2018. He subsequently released his debut EP *Fucc The Doubters* on August 24, 2018, with features from Dave East, [Don Q](:Don_Q_%28rapper%29) and [Mac](:Mac_%28rapper%29) and it peaked at 148 on the US Billboard 200.His second EP, *No Turning Bacc* was released on April 20, 2019, and his debut Solo LP *[Still Outside](:Still_Outside)* dropped on March 27, 2020. Shooter was signed to [Nas](:Nas_%28rapper%29)'s [Mass Appeal](:Mass_Appeal_Records) record label and Nas's brother [Jungle](:Jungle_%28rapper%29)'s [Street Dreams](:Street_Dreams_Records) record label."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
