<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Floyd_Jones> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Floyd Jones** (July 21, 1917 – December 19, 1989) was an African-American [blues](:Blues) singer, guitarist and songwriter. He was one of the first of the new generation of [electric blues](:Electric_blues) artists to record in Chicago after [World War II](:World_War_II), and a number of his [recordings](:Sound_recording_and_reproduction) are regarded as classics of the [Chicago blues](:Chicago_blues) idiom."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
