<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Balam_(singer)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "B. Alam, short for Bodiul Alam Jahangir, known as Balam, (born 24 December 1976) is a Bangladeshi singer, guitarist, composer, and music producer. He was born in Dhamaron village in Tongibari Upazila of Munshiganj (Bikrampur) district. He used to be the lead guitarist/vocalist for the band Warfaze. Later he introduced himself as a solo singer. In 2019 he joined LRB as a lead guitarist/vocalist."@en .
