<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Paul_Sartin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Paul Sartin** (20 February 1971 – 14 September 2022) was an English singer, instrumentalist, composer and arranger, specialising in [oboe](:Oboe) and [violin](:Violin). He was best known for his work with the folk band [Bellowhead](:Bellowhead), but also played with three-piece [Faustus](:Faustus_%28band%29) and the folk/comedy duo [Belshazzar's Feast](:Belshazzar%27s_Feast_%28band%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
