<http://dbpedia.org/resource/WIFE_(musician)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**WIFE** is the solo project of Irish musician and singer James Kelly, formerly of the group [Altar of Plagues](:Altar_of_Plagues). The first WIFE single was released in October 2012 when Pitchfork premiered \"Bodies\".The debut WIFE album, *What's Between*, was released on [Tri Angle](:Tri_Angle_%28record_label%29) in June 2014 and featured additional production from [The Haxan Cloak](:The_Haxan_Cloak) and Roly Porter. The video for lead single \"Heart is a Far Light\" was released in July 2014.Kelly participated in the 2014 edition of the [Red Bull Music Academy](:Red_Bull_Music_Academy), which took place in Tokyo, Japan."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
