<http://dbpedia.org/resource/The_Tonight_Show_Band> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Tonight Show Band is the house band that plays on the American television variety show The Tonight Show. From 1962 until 1992, when the show was known as The Tonight Show Starring Johnny Carson, the band was a 17-piece big band, and was an important showcase for jazz on American television. During the Carson era, the band was always billed as \"The NBC Orchestra\" (not to be confused with the NBC Symphony Orchestra) and sometimes \"Doc Severinsen and the NBC Orchestra\"."@en .
