<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Victor_Bailey_(musician)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Victor Bailey** (March 27, 1960 – November 11, 2016) was an American [bass guitar](:Bass_guitar) player. He was the bassist for [Weather Report](:Weather_Report) during their final years from 1982 to 1986, and launched a solo career in 1988. As a musician, Bailey was known for his signature scat-bass solos."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
