<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Francesco_Boschi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Francesco Boschi** (1619–1675) was an Italian painter of the [Baroque](:Baroque) period, active mainly in [Florence](:Florence). He was the pupil of his father, [Fabrizio Boschi](:Fabrizio_Boschi) as well as his uncle, the painter [Matteo Rosselli](:Matteo_Rosselli). Born in Florence. He was noted for portraits. He painted the portrait of *[Galileo](:Galileo)* now in the Louvre."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
