<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Robert_Vincent_(musician)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Robert Vincent (born 1981) is an English, Liverpool based Americana, blues and country music singer-songwriter, who was born in Crosby, England. Vincent is a singer songwriter firmly in the 'Americana' genre, with apparent influences from both country and blues singers. Vincent tours extensively, mainly in a support capacity (as of 2015), although in 2015 he was due to see his first headline tour with his band, so his growing popularity may change this over time. Vincent's first album was released in download and two forms of physical CD. The two forms of physical CD are a traditional single CD with 12 tracks, and a 'Deluxe' version that used a book style CD cover (mirroring a line from the title track of the album), with a bonus CD adding more tracks."@en .
