<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Katori,_Chiba> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Katori** (香取市, *Katori-shi*) is a [city](:Cities_of_Japan) located in [Chiba Prefecture](:Chiba_Prefecture), [Japan](:Japan). As of 1 November 2020[[update]](//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Katori,_Chiba&action=edit), the city had an estimated [population](:Population) of 74,469 in 31,113 households and a [population density](:Population_density) of 280 persons per km2. The total area of the city is 262.31 square kilometres (101.28 sq mi). [Katori Shrine](:Katori_Shrine) is in the city of Katori, as is the old merchant town and canal of [Sawara](:Sawara%2C_Chiba)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
