<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Aguadilla,_Puerto_Rico> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Aguadilla** (Template:IPA-es, Template:IPA-es), founded in 1775 by Luis de Córdova, is a [city](:Aguadilla_barrio-pueblo) and [municipality](:Municipalities_of_Puerto_Rico) located in the northwestern tip of [Puerto Rico](:Puerto_Rico), bordered by the [Atlantic Ocean](:Atlantic_Ocean) to the north and west, north of [Aguada](:Aguada%2C_Puerto_Rico), and [Moca](:Moca%2C_Puerto_Rico) and west of [Isabela](:Isabela%2C_Puerto_Rico). Aguadilla is spread over 15 *barrios* and [Aguadilla Pueblo](:Aguadilla_barrio-pueblo) (the downtown area and the administrative center of the city). It is a principal city and core of the [Aguadilla-Isabela-San Sebastián Metropolitan Statistical Area](:Aguadilla-Isabela-San_Sebasti%C3%A1n_Metropolitan_Statistical_Area)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
