<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Deakin_(musician)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Joshua Caleb Dibb** (born January 6, 1978), also known by his moniker **Deakin**, is an American musician who co-founded the [experimental pop](:Experimental_pop) band [Animal Collective](:Animal_Collective). He is the most infrequent member of the collective appearing on only six of the group's eleven studio albums. In 2016, he made his solo debut with the album *[Sleep Cycle](:Sleep_Cycle)*. He also occasionally works as a [carpenter](:Carpentry) during musical down time."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
