<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Margaret_Scott_(dancer)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Dame Catherine Margaret Mary Scott**, [DBE](:Dame_Commander_of_the_Order_of_the_British_Empire), [AC](:Companion_of_the_Order_of_Australia) (26 April 1922 – 24 February 2019) was a [South African](:South_Africa)-born pioneering [ballet](:Ballet) dancer who found fame as a teacher, choreographer, and school administrator in [Australia](:Australia). As the first director of the [Australian Ballet School](:Australian_Ballet_School), she is recognised as one of the founders of the strong ballet tradition of her adopted country."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
