<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Romance_(love)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Romance or romantic love is a feeling of love for, or a strong attraction towards another person, and the courtship behaviors undertaken by an individual to express those overall feelings and resultant emotions. Alternatively, Collins Dictionary describes romantic love as \"an intensity and idealization of a love relationship, in which the other is imbued with extraordinary virtue, beauty, etc., so that the relationship overrides all other considerations, including material ones.\""@en .
