<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Aleppo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Aleppo (/əˈlɛpoʊ/ ə-LEH-poh; Arabic: ﺣَﻠَﺐ / ALA-LC: Ḥalab, IPA: [ˈħalab]) is a city in Syria, which serves as the capital of the Aleppo Governorate, the most populous Syrian governorate. With an estimated population of 2,098,000 residents as of 2021, it is Syria's second-largest city and also one of the largest cities in the Levant region."@en .
