<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Dean_Dillon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Dean Dillon** (born **Larry Dean Flynn**; March 26, 1955) is an American [country](:Country_music) musician and songwriter. Between 1982 and 1993, he recorded six studio albums on various labels, and charted several singles on the *[Billboard](:Billboard_%28magazine%29)* country charts. Since 1993, Dillon has continued to write hit songs for other artists, most notably [George Strait](:George_Strait).In 2002, Dillon was inducted into the [Nashville Songwriters Hall of Fame](:Nashville_Songwriters_Hall_of_Fame). In 2020, he was inducted into the [Country Music Hall of Fame](:Country_Music_Hall_of_Fame_and_Museum)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
