<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Armin_van_Buuren> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Armin Jozef Jacobus Daniël van Buuren (/væn ˈbjʊərən/ van BURE-ən, Dutch: [ˈɑrmɪ‿ˈɲoːzəf jaːˈkoːbʏz‿ˈdaːnijɛl vɑm‿ˈbyːrə(n)]; born 25 December 1976) is a Dutch DJ and record producer from Leiden, South Holland. Since 2001, he has hosted A State of Trance (ASOT), a weekly radio show, which is broadcast to nearly 40 million listeners in 84 countries on over 100 FM radio stations. According to the website DJs and Festivals, \"the radio show propelled him to stardom and helped cultivate an interest in trance music around the world\"."@en .
