<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Paul_Sartin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Paul Sartin (20 February 1971 – 14 September 2022) was an English singer, instrumentalist, composer and arranger, specialising in oboe and violin. He was best known for his work with the folk band Bellowhead, but also played with three-piece Faustus and the folk/comedy duo Belshazzar's Feast."@en .
