<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Operetta> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Operetta is a form of theatre and a genre of light opera. It includes spoken dialogue, songs, and dances. It is lighter than opera in terms of its music, orchestral size, length of the work, and at face value, subject matter. Apart from its shorter length, the operetta is usually of a light and amusing character. It sometimes also includes satirical commentaries."@en .
