<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Holly_Andres> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Holly Andres (born 1977) is an American photographer and writer based in Portland, Oregon. Andres's work focuses on flamboyant, movie-like scenes which draw inspiration from her experiences as a child. Andres has said that she views her photo subjects as protagonists within a larger narrative. Usually, Andres's photographs take one of two moods: either \"dark and mysterious or bright and witty.\""@en .
