<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Iyaz> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Keidran Jones** (born 15 April 1987), better known by his [stage name](:Stage_name) **Iyaz**, is a [British Virgin Islands](:British_Virgin_Islands) singer and songwriter, formerly signed with the record label [Beluga Heights Records](:Beluga_Heights_Records). He is known for his singles \"[Replay](:Replay_%28Iyaz_song%29)\", \"[Solo](:Solo_%28Iyaz_song%29)\" and \"[Pretty Girls](:Pretty_Girls_%28Iyaz_song%29)\". He released his debut album *[Replay](:Replay_%28Iyaz_album%29)* in 2010."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
