<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mike_Docherty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Michael Docherty** (September 11, 1955 – January 19, 2016) was a Scottish [comic book](:Comic_book) and [animation](:Animation) artist living in [California](:California). He is best known for his work on [Marvel Comic's](:Marvel_Comic) 1980s and 1990s [Conan comics](:Conan_%28comics%29).Since the mid-1990s he began on drawing concept designs and storyboards for animation, live-action TV and movie projects, but mainly focusing on animation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
