<http://dbpedia.org/resource/DJ_Dean> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**DJ Dean** (born as **Martin Schmidt** October 25, 1976 in [Hamburg](:Hamburg), Germany) is a German [Euro-trance](:Eurodance)/[hard trance](:Hard_trance) DJ, producer, and current longtime resident DJ of the Tunnel dance club in Hamburg. He is also the founder of the German trance label [Tunnel Records](:Tunnel_Records), which has released successful trance/hard trance compilations under the [Tunnel Trance Force](:Tunnel_Trance_Force) and [DJ Networx](:DJ_Networx) franchises."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
