<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kirkenes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Kirkenes (Norwegian: [ˈçîrkəneːs]; Northern Sami: Girkonjárga; Skolt Sami: Ǩeârkknjargg; Finnish: Kirkkoniemi; Kven: Kirkkoniemi; Russian: Киркенес) is a town in Sør-Varanger Municipality in Troms og Finnmark county, in the far northeastern part of Norway. The town lies on a peninsula along the Bøkfjorden, an arm of the large Varangerfjorden. The main church for Kirkenes is Kirkenes Church, located in the Haganes area of the town. Kirkenes is located just a few kilometres from the Norway-Russia border."@en .
