<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Tommys> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Tommys** is a [dansband](:Dansband) from [Vaasa](:Vaasa), established in [1980](:1980_in_music). [Hans Martin](:Hans_Martin_%28singer%29) was the singer from establishment until the year [2000](:2000_in_music). During the 1980s, the band mostly played throughout [Ostrobothnia](:Ostrobothnia_%28region%29), and [Swedish-speaking parts](:Svenskfinland) of [southern Finland](:Southern_Finland). In [Sweden](:Sweden), the breakthrough was their [1991](:1991_in_music) hit \"Vår dotter\"."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
